    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, when using the clone ability, a multiple master can create up to the maximum number of clones that he may have out at a time at once. These still subtract from the total number of clones he can make per day. He must still have enough adjacent squares to house all the new clones.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/multiple-master#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
